                                "sense_id": "4b4e1bef-8ae7-3a79-83d7-40d8602c3b6e",
                                "text": "'Tis very wild to look on through time in the passing bell, while man as an animal rages, his infernate passion being blind! for men and beasts, birds, and fishes, are all known by their essenced voices—vegitative music having a wide gamut in ambrosiate gales and rank poisons."
                            }
